{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>近日，據社交平台爆料，阿里巴巴旗下旅遊平台飛豬即將迎來大批量裁員。關於此次裁員，目前社交平台説法存在一定差異。有阿里巴巴集團員工表示裁員40%還是有的。另有極端説法稱裁員比例達98%，但也有認證飛豬員工稱 「沒有這麼多吧，雖然是很多」。</p>\n<p>截至發稿，飛豬官方尚未對裁員傳聞作出公開回應。</p>\n<p>\n\n</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://static.cnbetacdn.com/article/2026/0616/d868de4c68f362b.webp\"/>\n</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://static.cnbetacdn.com/article/2026/0616/a361ad1cbd19832.webp\"/>\n</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://static.cnbetacdn.com/article/2026/0616/88bfa10ec97c115.webp\"/>\n</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://static.cnbetacdn.com/article/2026/0616/c00299dfcda5404.webp\"/>\n</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://static.cnbetacdn.com/article/2026/0616/1dde3bb7e4ff2b3.webp\"/>\n</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://static.cnbetacdn.com/article/2026/0616/167be0ccdc5c85c.webp\"/>\n</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://static.cnbetacdn.com/article/2026/0616/4b6a20c5028716d.webp\"/>\n</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://static.cnbetacdn.com/article/2026/0616/d868de4c68f362b.webp\"/>\n</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://static.cnbetacdn.com/article/2026/0616/a361ad1cbd19832.webp\"/>\n</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://static.cnbetacdn.com/article/2026/0616/88bfa10ec97c115.webp\"/>\n</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://static.cnbetacdn.com/article/2026/0616/c00299dfcda5404.webp\"/>\n</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://static.cnbetacdn.com/article/2026/0616/1dde3bb7e4ff2b3.webp\"/>\n</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://static.cnbetacdn.com/article/2026/0616/167be0ccdc5c85c.webp\"/>\n</p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-06-16T05:42:05.121076+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":142,"images":13,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"unknown"}}